    <briefdescription>
<para>Black (1976) stochastic process. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the stochastic process for a forward or futures contract given by <formula id="330">\[ dS(t, S) = \frac{\sigma(t, S)^2}{2} dt + \sigma dW_t. \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
